ionary Guards said an oil tanker ignited after striking a naval mine while using what they called an unauthorized route through the Strait of Hormuz; the vessel was not identified and the claim was not independently verified. It follows similar IRGC claims on Oct 10 (supertanker) and Oct 14 (container ship).", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/10/17/draft-2", "source": "Al Jazeera / FinancialJuice", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": 0.183, "via": "freight"}, {"id": "abe9106c05b2", "ts": "2026-10-16T18:09:42Z", "title": "Indian official says crude tanker targeted by missile in Strait of Hormuz", "summary": "An Indian shipping official said a crude oil tanker was targeted by a missile in the Strait of Hormuz on Friday and also referred to the recent Romania-linked tanker incident; it adds to this week's string of attacks on Gulf shipping.", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "source": "Newsquawk", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": 0.171, "via": "freight"}, {"id": "c0d6d197835e", "ts": "2026-10-14T06:00:00Z", "title": "Iran deploys new tactics against ships; two vessels struck in Strait of Hormuz", "summary": "Brent rose to about $106.32 early on 14 Oct after two vessels were hit. Kpler: only 2.9m barrels moved through Hormuz on 11 Oct vs 17.1m b/d pre-war.", "url": "https://euronews.com/2026/10/14/oil-prices-rise-after-reported-attacks-on-ships-in-strait-of-hormuz", "source": "Euronews", "scale": "major", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": 0.143, "via": "freight"}, {"id": "88a3c3bb6857", "ts": "2026-10-13T20:00:00Z", "title": "Houthi missile hits Saudi Aramco headquarters in Dhahran; Houthis vow more attacks on Saudi oil sites", "summary": "A Houthi ballistic missile struck an office tower at Aramco's Dhahran complex late on 13 October, causing a fire; Saudi officials said there were no injuries and operations continued. Brent settled near $106 on 14 